{"articleNo":"90876","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=90876&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"(대학원)2013-2학기 대학원 박사과정 학생 석사이수학점 인정 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.09.06","hit":"4534","attachments":[{"name":"박사과정 학생 석사이수학점 인정 신청원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=90876&attachNo=3333"},{"name":"대학원 박사과정 학생의 석사이수학점 인정 기준.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=90876&attachNo=3360"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 416.71pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND: #e3f4e3; HEIGHT: 64.46pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY울릉도M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-2학기 대학원 박사과정 학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY울릉도M\" lang=\"EN-US\">석사이수학점 인정 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013-2학기 대학원 박사과정 학생의 석사이수학점인정 신청에 관한 사항을 안내하오니 해당 학생들은 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 학점인정 대상 : 본교 석사과정 졸업생 중 동일계열 박사과정으로 진학한 경우 석사과정 졸업 시 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">전공과목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">으로 24학점을 초과하여 취득한 학점</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 인정학점 : 6학점까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">초과 이수학점이 최소 3학점 이상이어야 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 초과학점이 4학점인 경우 : 3학점 1과목 인정 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 제출서류 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 박사과정 학생 석사 이수과목 학점인정 신청원 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 석사과정 성적증명서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청일자 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 09. 09(월) ~ 09. 12(목)[4일간]</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 제출처 : 대학원 각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 참고사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 학점인정 방법 : 해당 학과 교육과정에 편성된 과목으로 인정하되 학점은 인정되나 평점에는 반영되지 않으며 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">“S”</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">로 표기됨 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 학점인정 시기 : 신청 당해 학기</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 09.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
